# Pokemon Center nurse (original design).
# Wave 0 palette-swap split: the legs used the hair key P (same hex), so
# hair and pants could not be remapped independently. Legs now use T,
# declared with the SAME hex P always had — default pixels unchanged;
# at runtime P remaps to the instance's hair color and T to its pants.
# Overworld idle frame 1.
PIX npc-nurse-idle-1 16 16
